  "claimBoundary": "Current is the immutable v9 final: Search 50, RAG 50, Agent 25, executed once with real Provider preflight and all hard gates passed. Customer-service understanding has a separate 60-case HUMAN_VERIFIED offline package and a 60/60 production HTTP observation run; same-gold slot replay improved Span F1 from 0.907652 to 0.996364 and exact match from 0.558824 to 0.911765 with zero regressions, but it is not a new holdout. Two independent HTTP-answer reviews have 52/60 four-label exact agreement, and an independent third reviewer adjudicated all 8 disagreements. The resulting fixed-replay answer correctness is 51/60=85.0%, citation grounding support is 6/30=20.0%, handoff appropriateness is 60/60, unsafe-answer rate is 0/60, and joint quality is 32/60=53.3%. Agreement is annotation reliability, not model accuracy; this package is non-gating and does not establish CSAT/FCR, online success, or grounded-answer readiness. Redacted HTTP slots remain UNAVAILABLE. The additional 60-case v2 dataset remains a dual-review draft and is not part of any reported denominator. The 10-case Search hard-negative paired replay establishes no regression and zero metric delta, not a quality gain or a new final. Local read-only capacity evidence covers four cases, concurrency 1/2/4/8, warm-up 4 excluded from the denominator, and 20 formal requests per level (80 total); it is diagnostic only, not sustained production capacity or an SLO. Semantic judging is shadow-only until independent human calibration; missing usage or pricing is never converted to zero cost; no result establishes CTR, CVR, GMV, payment compliance, unit economics, or industrial personalization.",
